ferring to. The MEMORY.md shows I was assigned to the 势位之战 frontend work, but there's also the ECHO v2 style unification issue. I need to clarify with the user whether they're asking about the battle game tabs or the ECHO v2 pages before I can properly assess what's actually been completed.","thinkingSignature":"91f0a23947da38e8183b94189226921f20e262050a56af78ed51d3599f2609e8"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n等等，我需要厘清一个问题。\n\nmemory里记的是两件事：\n\n**ECHO v2 四页面（2026-06-01验收）：**\n境/典/源/竞 — 其中\"境\"白底，其他深色 → 风格未统一\n\n**势位之战（2026-06-02启动）：**\n铸造/编排/对战/地图 — 这是我负责的前端项目，目前看起来已经是暖白底了\n\n---\n\n这两个是同一个项目吗？还是EHO v2的四个页面和势位之战的四个tab需要分别处理？\n\n我先确认一下ECHO v2的代码在哪里。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0ffe7eecb4c8489b9507d166","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/ | grep -i echo"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":696,"output":775,"cacheRead":37248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38719,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780482626162,"responseId":"066f3542112428f493de77c942027be9"}}
