{"type":"message","id":"cf8f556a","parentId":"234e2b0e","timestamp":"2026-06-03T10:31:09.908Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the situation clearly:\n\n**ECHO v2** (the 4 pages: 境/典/源/竞) - currently dark themed (`bg-neutral-950`), needs to be unified to warm white `#FAF9F7`.\n\n**势位之战** (echo-battle-frontend) - already has warm white `#FAF9F7` as background, so this one is already done.\n\nSo the task is: change echo-v2 from dark theme to warm white theme.\n\nLet me look at each page to understand what needs to change. The main styling comes from:\n1. `App.jsx` - `bg-neutral-950` → `bg-[#FAF9F7]`, `text-white` → `text-[#2D2A26]`\n\n\n2. The `WalletBar` component and individual pages likely have hardcoded dark styles that need updating\n\nLet me start by checking what the JingPage currently looks like to see how extensive these changes need to be.","thinkingSignature":"4d9a867f927dd8f4a408716833ab809e8a4452cd37d429052d710e4683b72956"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n搞清楚了：\n\n- **echo-v2**（境/典/源/竞）：深色 `bg-neutral-950` → **需要改成暖白底**\n- **echo-battle-frontend**（铸造/编排/对战/地图）：已经是暖白底 ✅\n\n两个是不同的项目。来做 echo-v2 的风格统一。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6679bf53e4024f8180dfc599","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"head -60 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/src/pages/JingPage.jsx"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1101,"output":324,"cacheRead":38720,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40145,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780482664683,"responseId":"066f3569a780bca3db91d645e16fe156"}}
{"type":"message","id":"256e9aed","parentId":"cf8f556a","timestamp":"2026-06-03T10:31:10.068Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_6679bf53e4024f8180dfc599","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"import { useRef, useEffect, useState } from 'react';\nimport { checkVersionCompatibility, ALPHA_7_CONSTRAINT } from '../utils/versionCompat';\n\nconst CURRENT_ECHO_VERSION = '1.1.0';\nconst API_BASE = 'https://echo-api.meerfans.club';\n\nconst PHASE_NAMES = ['纳相', '展相', '照相', '议相', '决相', '映相'];\nconst PHASES = PHASE_NAMES.map((name, shiPosition) => ({\n  name,\n  desc: ['争议受理', '证据展示', '观点对照', '群体审议', '共识裁决', '结果映现'][shiPosition],\n  shiPosition,\n}));\n\nfunction PotentialChart({ history }) {\n  const canvasRef = useRef(null);\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const canvas = canvasRef.current;\n    if (!canvas || !history || history.length === 0) return;\n    const parent = canvas.parentElement;\n    if (!parent) return;\n    const w = parent.clientWidth;\n    const h = 112;\n    canvas.width = w * 2;\n    canvas.height = h * 2;\n    canvas.style.width = w + 'px';\n    canvas.style.height = h + 'px';\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n    ctx.scale(2, 2);\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\n    const values = history.map(h => h.potential || h.potentialValue || 0);\n    const max = Math.max(...values, 0.01);\n    const min = Math.min(...values, 0);\n    const range = max - min || 0.01;\n\n    // 淡墨网格\n    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(168,163,154,0.2)';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n    for (let i = 1; i < 5; i++) {\n      const y = (i / 5) * h;\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0, y); ctx.lineTo(w, y); ctx.stroke();\n    }\n\n    // 心电图折线 - 朱砂色\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#c45c48';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n    values.forEach((v, i) => {\n      const x = (i / (values.length - 1)) * w;\n      const y = (1 - (v - min) / range) * h;\n      i === 0 ? ctx.moveTo(x, y) : ctx.lineTo(x, y);\n    });\n    ctx.stroke();\n\n    // 节点圆点\n    values.forEach((v, i) => {\n      const x = (i / (values.length - 1)) * w;\n      const y = (1 - (v - min) / range) * h;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#c45c48';"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":46,"aggregated":"import { useRef, useEffect, useState } from 'react';\nimport { checkVersionCompatibility, ALPHA_7_CONSTRAINT } from '../utils/versionCompat';\n\nconst CURRENT_ECHO_VERSION = '1.1.0';\nconst API_BASE = 'https://echo-api.meerfans.club';\n\nconst PHASE_NAMES = ['纳相', '展相', '照相', '议相', '决相', '映相'];\nconst PHASES = PHASE_NAMES.map((name, shiPosition) => ({\n  name,\n  desc: ['争议受理', '证据展示', '观点对照', '群体审议', '共识裁决', '结果映现'][shiPosition],\n  shiPosition,\n}));\n\nfunction PotentialChart({ history }) {\n  const canvasRef = useRef(null);\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const canvas = canvasRef.current;\n    if (!canvas || !history || history.length === 0) return;\n    const parent = canvas.parentElement;\n    if (!parent) return;\n    const w = parent.clientWidth;\n    const h = 112;\n    canvas.width = w * 2;\n    canvas.height = h * 2;\n    canvas.style.width = w + 'px';\n    canvas.style.height = h + 'px';\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n    ctx.scale(2, 2);\n    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\n    const values = history.map(h => h.potential || h.potentialValue || 0);\n    const max = Math.max(...values, 0.01);\n    const min = Math.min(...values, 0);\n    const range = max - min || 0.01;\n\n    // 淡墨网格\n    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(168,163,154,0.2)';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n    for (let i = 1; i < 5; i++) {\n      const y = (i / 5) * h;\n      ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0, y); ctx.lineTo(w, y); ctx.stroke();\n    }\n\n    // 心电图折线 - 朱砂色\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.strokeStyle = '#c45c48';\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n    values.forEach((v, i) => {\n      const x = (i / (values.length - 1)) * w;\n      const y = (1 - (v - min) / range) * h;\n      i === 0 ? ctx.moveTo(x, y) : ctx.lineTo(x, y);\n    });\n    ctx.stroke();\n\n    // 节点圆点\n    values.forEach((v, i) => {\n      const x = (i / (values.length - 1)) * w;\n      const y = (1 - (v - min) / range) * h;\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#c45c48';","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780482670064}}
