{"type":"message","id":"6d60f341","parentId":"7214b0b0","timestamp":"2026-06-03T10:32:06.332Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! All three pages (Dian, Yuan, JingComp) are already using `bg-[#faf9f7]` (cream background) and light text. They seem to already be on the light theme. The only dark elements are:\n\n1. The `App.jsx` main container had `bg-neutral-950` - now fixed\n2. Navigation links had `text-neutral-400 hover:text-white` etc. - now fixed\n3. The WalletBar had `bg-neutral-800` - needs fixing\n\nSo the main remaining issue is WalletBar, which has `bg-neutral-800` for the disconnect button and `text-neutral-400` for balance. Let me fix WalletBar now.","thinkingSignature":"1596cd48daea59a779859990428325d04bbc1aaf5758ca9968e73a339b44c2c0"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n三个页面都已经是暖白底了。只有 `WalletBar` 和 `App.jsx` 是深色（App.jsx 已改）。WalletBar 还需要修：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_94877137d2eb467a8e5551be","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"import { useState, useEffect } from 'react';\nimport { useWalletContext } from '../contexts/WalletContext';\n\nexport default function WalletBar() {\n  const { provider, address, connect, disconnect, isConnected } = useWalletContext();\n  const [balance, setBalance] = useState(null);\n  const [exiting, setExiting] = useState(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!provider || !address) { setBalance(null); return; }\n    provider.getBalance(address).then(b => setBalance(Number(b) / 1e18)).catch(() => setBalance(null));\n  }, [provider, address]);\n\n  const handleDisconnect = () => {\n    setExiting(true);\n    setTimeout(() => { setExiting(false); disconnect(); }, 250);\n  };\n\n  if (isConnected) {\n    return (\n      <div className={`flex items-center gap-3 transition-all duration-300 ${exiting ? 'opacity-0 translate-y-1' : 'opacity-100 translate-y-0'}`}>\n        <span className=\"text-sm text-[#6B665C]\">{balance?.toFixed(4)} MEER</span>\n        <span className=\"font-mono text-sm text-[#2D2A26]\">{address.slice(0,6)}...{address.slice(-4)}</span>\n        <button onClick={handleDisconnect} className=\"text-xs border border-[#E5E2DC] px-2 py-1 rounded hover:border-[#2D2A26] transition-colors text-[#6B665C] hover:text-[#2D2A26]\">断开</button>\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n  return <button onClick={connect} className=\"text-xs bg-[#6B9E87] text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:bg-[#5a8a76] transition-colors\">连接钱包</button>;\n}\n","path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/src/components/WalletBar.jsx"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1607,"output":653,"cacheRead":47680,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49940,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780482718122,"responseId":"066f359ed0904b2553d214570e520f95"}}
