{"type":"message","id":"0f254329","parentId":"1b7bbb60","timestamp":"2026-06-04T01:43:00.704Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Boss 问反应延迟几秒是哪个配置在起作用。让我看看现有的几个相关配置。\n\n我看到几个可能导致延迟的配置：\n\n1. **`humanDelay.mode: \"natural\"`** — 模拟人类自然打字的延迟\n2. **`blockStreamingChunk`** — 块流式输出设置\n3. **`blockStreamingCoalesce.idleMs: 1000`** — 空闲合并时间\n\n最可能是 `humanDelay` —— 它故意加延迟让交互看起来更像人类。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ohzl50z80g11_1","name":"gateway","arguments":{"action":"config.schema.lookup","path":"agents.defaults.humanDelay"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":5696,"output":142,"cacheRead":89074,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94912,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780537374163,"responseId":"06700b1ea0b6e625385eef8791cc7b33"}}
{"type":"message","id":"548281e1","parentId":"0f254329","timestamp":"2026-06-04T01:43:01.058Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ohzl50z80g11_1","toolName":"gateway","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"result\": {\n    \"path\": \"agents.defaults.humanDelay\",\n    \"schema\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"reloadKind\": \"none\",\n    \"children\": [\n      {\n        \"key\": \"mode\",\n        \"path\": \"agents.defaults.humanDelay.mode\",\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"hasChildren\": false,\n        \"reloadKind\": \"none\",\n        \"hint\": {\n          \"label\": \"Human Delay Mode\",\n          \"help\": \"Delay style for block replies (\\\"off\\\", \\\"natural\\\", \\\"custom\\\").\",\n          \"tags\": [\n            \"advanced\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"hintPath\": \"agents.defaults.humanDelay.mode\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"key\": \"minMs\",\n        \"path\": \"agents.defaults.humanDelay.minMs\",\n        \"type\": \"integer\",\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"hasChildren\": false,\n        \"reloadKind\": \"none\",\n        \"hint\": {\n          \"label\": \"Human Delay Min (ms)\",\n          \"help\": \"Minimum delay in ms for custom humanDelay (default: 800).\",\n          \"tags\": [\n            \"advanced\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"hintPath\": \"agents.defaults.humanDelay.minMs\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"key\": \"maxMs\",\n        \"path\": \"agents.defaults.humanDelay.maxMs\",\n        \"type\": \"integer\",\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"hasChildren\": false,\n        \"reloadKind\": \"none\",\n        \"hint\": {\n          \"label\": \"Human Delay Max (ms)\",\n          \"help\": \"Maximum delay in ms for custom humanDelay (default: 2500).\",\n          \"tags\": [\n            \"performance\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"hintPath\": \"agents.defaults.humanDelay.maxMs\"\n   