{"type":"message","id":"9d949228","parentId":"548281e1","timestamp":"2026-06-04T01:43:07.585Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"找到了。`humanDelay.mode: \"natural\"` —— 这个设置让响应故意延迟，模拟人类打字节奏。\n\n**具体配置：**\n```json\n\"humanDelay\": {\n  \"mode\": \"natural\"\n}\n```\n\n**`natural` 模式原理：**\n- 按打字速度计算延迟（字符数 × 打字 WPM）\n- 范围大概是 800ms ~ 2500ms\n- 大概就是你说的\"几秒\"\n\n**解决方案：**\n\n把它关掉（设为 `\"off\"`）就立即响应：\n```json\n\"humanDelay\": {\n  \"mode\": \"off\"\n}\n```\n\n需要我关掉吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":437,"output":131,"cacheRead":94898,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95466,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780537381060,"responseId":"06700b250984f4e8806e05f8a6418759"}}
