{"type":"message","id":"90b1ff10","parentId":"9b077bf5","timestamp":"2026-06-04T01:46:18.401Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Boss asks if it takes effect without restart. Let me check the reloadKind for humanDelay.\n\n刚才查 schema 的时候显示 `reloadKind: \"none\"` —— 这个 key 不会热重载。但 schema 上写的是 hot 还是 none 跟 OpenClaw 的实际行为可能不一致，让我查清楚。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_e4q823icbgst_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\npath = '/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json'\nwith open(path, 'r') as f:\n    c = json.load(f)\n# 看 hash\nprint('hash:', c.get('meta', {}).get('lastTouchedAt'))\nprint('humanDelay:', c['agents']['defaults'].get('humanDelay'))\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":563,"output":162,"cacheRead":95218,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95943,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780537571733,"responseId":"06700be4fe3505071d1255f972649918"}}
