{"type":"message","id":"57266610","parentId":"c8ddb4b9","timestamp":"2026-06-04T02:30:26.086Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"确认了，是 Docker 部署（container id: 7048705f208d）。但容器内没有 docker CLI——因为这是 Docker-in-Docker 场景，或者只是 OpenClaw 跑在容器里而 docker socket 没挂载进来。\n\n最安全的重启方式：调用 `gateway` 工具的 restart action。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_97tlrvay9vfo_1","name":"gateway","arguments":{"action":"restart","delayMs":2000,"reason":"Apply humanDelay.mode=off (file edit, not config.patch)","note":"重启以应用 humanDelay.mode=off 配置"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":300,"output":142,"cacheRead":96260,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96702,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780540219354,"responseId":"0670163ca16e88632d1ec461a791f9c4"}}
