{"type":"message","id":"f0e2d699","parentId":"6b33e984","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:15:35.425Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"收到，原因有两个：\n\n1. **回复是 OpenClaw 自带的\"中断续接\"提示**——重启后系统自动注入的英文模板（\"The gateway restart completed successfully. Tell the user OpenClaw restarted successfully and continue any pending work.\"），不是我主动写的。我后来手动加的中文部分是直接补的。\n\n2. **现在起正常中文回复，禁用英文模板。**\n\n---\n\n继续——Seaman_bot 3 项里你要先推联调，明天要事件监听脚本，分账验证后立刻执行。我要不要在群里@他确认下具体时间？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":97119,"output":118,"cacheRead":114,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97351,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780542926832,"responseId":"067020cfa97ac4c4b586c633b3380d0f"}}
