{"type":"message","id":"c2f3eade","parentId":"095ffbf5","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:21:03.753Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"有，几个常用路子：\n\n**1. `doc-summarize-pro`**\n总结文档，喂给模型前先压成摘要，省大量输入 token。\n\n**2. `freeride` / `openclaw-free-models`**\n切到免费模型（OpenRouter free tier、GLM-4.5 Flash 等），零成本。\n\n**3. `find-skills` / 主动瘦身 skills**\nskills 多了 prompt 体积大，加载用不上的就是纯浪费。\n\n**4. `memory_search` + 短上下文**\n少塞完整文件，用搜索按需取——MEMORY.md + memory/*.md 索引就是为此设计的。\n\n**5. 配合 prompt 习惯：**\n- 简短指令，别一次塞 5 个任务\n- 工具输出截断（`max_chars`、`head -50` 之类）\n- 大文件 `read` 用 `offset/limit` 分页\n\n---\n\n**最直接的两个：**\n\n- `doc-summarize-pro` 喂资料时先压\n- 长对话用 memory_search 查旧信息，不要全文塞\n\n要试试吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":790,"output":230,"cacheRead":96626,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97646,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780543253997,"responseId":"067022161619d70dbb811d34ace3e024"}}
