{"type":"message","id":"afa6c1af","parentId":"08f23920","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:22:28.975Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"装了。`doc-summarize-pro` 在 `/home/node/.openclaw/skills/doc-summarize-pro/`，已启用。\n\n**功能：** 智能摘要、要点提取、执行摘要、章节拆分、多文档对比、翻译+摘要。\n\n**使用方式：** 喂文件路径或 URL，让它先压成摘要再喂给模型，省 token。\n\n---\n\n另外看到 `model-usage` skill——是统计 token 消耗的，可以看哪些对话最费 token，针对性优化。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":268,"output":100,"cacheRead":97800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98168,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780543342967,"responseId":"0670226fc3841d4b17695dd6f5074553"}}
