{"type":"message","id":"52e7aa3a","parentId":"6274d853","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:23:00.510Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_u0k47vjn1iys_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: model-usage\ndescription: Use CodexBar CLI local cost usage to summarize per-model usage for Codex or Claude, including the current (most recent) model or a full model breakdown. Trigger when asked for model-level usage/cost data from codexbar, or when you need a scriptable per-model summary from codexbar cost JSON.\nmetadata: {\"clawdbot\":{\"emoji\":\"📊\",\"os\":[\"darwin\"],\"requires\":{\"bins\":[\"codexbar\"]},\"install\":[{\"id\":\"brew-cask\",\"kind\":\"brew\",\"cask\":\"steipete/tap/codexbar\",\"bins\":[\"codexbar\"],\"label\":\"Install CodexBar (brew cask)\"}]}}\n---\n\n# Model usage\n\n## Overview\nGet per-model usage cost from CodexBar's local cost logs. Supports \"current model\" (most recent daily entry) or \"all models\" summaries for Codex or Claude.\n\nTODO: add Linux CLI support guidance once CodexBar CLI install path is documented for Linux.\n\n## Quick start\n1) Fetch cost JSON via CodexBar CLI or pass a JSON file.\n2) Use the bundled script to summarize by model.\n\n```bash\npython {baseDir}/scripts/model_usage.py --provider codex --mode current\npython {baseDir}/scripts/model_usage.py --provider codex --mode all\npython {baseDir}/scripts/model_usage.py --provider claude --mode all --format json --pretty\n```\n\n## Current model logic\n- Uses the most recent daily row with `modelBreakdowns`.\n- Picks the model with the highest cost in that row.\n- Falls back to the last entry in `modelsUsed` when breakdowns are missing.\n- Override with `--model <name>` when you need a specific model.\n\n## Inputs\n- Default: runs `codexbar cost --format json --provider <codex|claude>`.\n- File or stdin:\n\n```bash\ncodexbar cost --provider codex --format json > /tmp/cost.json\npython {baseDir}/scripts/model_usage.py --input /tmp/cost.json --mode all\ncat /tmp/cost.json | python {baseDir}/scripts/model_usage.py --input - --mode current\n```\n\n## Output\n- Text (default) or JSON (`--format json --pretty`).\n- Values are cost-only per model; tokens are not split by model in CodexBar output.\n\n## References\n- Read `references/codexbar-cli.md` for CLI flags and cost JSON fields.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780543380498}}
{"type":"message","id":"abc0d597","parentId":"52e7aa3a","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:23:10.879Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是个 macOS 专属 skill——依赖 `codexbar`（macOS 应用），不适用于我跑的这个 Linux Docker 环境。\n\n**结论：当前环境下 `model-usage` 用不了。**\n\n---\n\n**替代方案：**\n\n1. **OpenClaw 自带的 token 统计** — `/status` 命令（或 `session_status` tool）就能看当前 session 的 token 用量、费用。\n2. **直接在 OpenClaw 控制台**（http://localhost:18789）看 sessions list，能看到每个 session 的 cost 统计。\n3. **查 nvidia/MiniMax portal 的 dashboard** — 各 provider 后台都有详细账单。\n\n要现在跑一个 `session_status` 看下当前 session 的用量吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":538,"output":150,"cacheRead":98272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98960,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780543380513,"responseId":"06702295270a4dfeecec2bb8e33a6af4"}}
{"type":"compaction","id":"4cc47372","parentId":"abc0d597","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:24:41.648Z","summary":"## Goal\nBoss 听风 想要：\n1. **ECHO v2 四个页面（境/典/源/竞）风格统一**为暖白底 `#FAF9F7`（与 ECHO v2 联调日 2026-06-01 提出的待办对齐）\n2. **解决 GitHub PAT 失效**问题，重新生成 token 并 push 代码\n3. **理解 Seaman_bot 群里求助的两个 git push 方案的原理**\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- 项目代码统一在 `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/`（不能去 `/home/ubuntu/` 找，那是另一台机器）\n- GitHub 仓库来源：`blocklee` 账号下\n- 听风要求\"主动干活\"——不接受\"等指令\"模式\n- 风格统一颜色：`#FAF9F7`（cream）、`#F2F0ED`（card）、`#E5E2DC`（border）、`#2D2A26`（ink）、`#6B665C`（muted）\n- 听风明确\"群聊只发链接，不贴全文\"是新规则\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] 读取 MEMORY.md / 2026-06-01.md / 2026-06-02.md 确认项目状态\n- [x] 定位目标项目：`echo-v2`（Vite + React，四页面：JingPage/DianPage/YuanPage/JingCompPage）\n- [x] 确认 `echo-battle-frontend` 已经是暖白底无需改\n- [x] 修改 `echo-v2/tailwind.config.js`：添加 cream/card/border/ink/muted/coral/sage/amber/emerald token\n- [x] 修改 `echo-v2/src/App.jsx`：`bg-neutral-950 text-white` → `bg-[#FAF9F7] text-[#2D2A26]`，导航颜色适配\n- [x] 修改 `echo-v2/src/components/WalletBar.jsx`：按钮/文字全部适配暖白底\n- [x] 修改 `echo-v2/src/components/ErrorBoundary.jsx`：错误页适配暖白底\n- [x] `npm run build` 两次都成功（vite 6.4.2，188 modules，dist 生成）\n- [x] 更新 `.env` 中 GITHUB_TOKEN 为新 token `ghp_hb…H7oa`（听风手动更新后我验证 200 OK，login=blocklee）\n- [x] 创建 GitHub 仓库 `blocklee/echo-v2`（公开，description: \"ECHO v2 Frontend - 境/典/源/竞 四页面暖白底主题\"）\n- [x] `git push -u origin main` 成功，commit `7ed601c`: \"style: unify all pages to warm white theme (#FAF9F7)\"\n- [x] 同步更新 `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md` 里的 token\n- [x] 向听风解释 Seaman_bot 两个 push 方案（A: SSH key / B: Token in URL）的原理\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] 等待听风决定下一步：Netlify/Vercel 部署？或者让 Seaman_bot 直接用相同流程推他自己的仓库？\n\n### Blocked\n- **Seaman_bot 的 push 阻塞**：他要推 `zhouyatingkol/echo-v2`（不是我的 `blocklee/echo-v2`），需要哪吒给 token 或 SSH key\n- **dist/ 部署脚本缺失**：`echo-v2/package.json` 只有 dev/build/preview，没有 deploy 脚本\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **区分两个项目**：`echo-battle-frontend`（势位之战，铸造/编排/对战/地图）≠ `echo-v2`（ECHO 协议展示，境/典/源/竞）。听风要改的是后者\n- **暖白底主题统一**：所有页面的 `bg-neutral-950`/`text-white` → `bg-[#FAF9F7]`/`text-[#2D2A26]`，active 指示色从 `emerald-500` 改为 `#6B9E87`\n- **新 token 走 HTTPS+PAT 路径**：因 `ssh: not found`，无法用 SSH\n- **远程仓库无 SSH key**：用 `git remote set-url origin https://TOKEN@github.com/...` 直接嵌入 token\n\n## Next Steps\n1. 听风确认是否需要部署 dist/（Netlify/Vercel？目前无 deploy 脚本）\n2. 听风协调哪吒给 Seaman_bot 配置 token 或 SSH，让他推 `zhouyatingkol/echo-v2`\n3. （可选）从 git 历史中清理 dist/ 入库，加 `.gitignore`\n4. （可选）记录今天进度到 `memory/2026-06-03.md`\n\n## Critical Context\n- **新 GitHub token（已验证有效）**：`ghp_hb…H7oa`（账户 blocklee，200 OK）\n- **仓库地址**：`https://github.com/blocklee/echo-v2`\n- **关键 commit**：`7ed601c` style: unify all pages to warm white theme (#FAF9F7)\n- **API 地址**：`https://echo-api.meerfans.club`\n- **本地路径**：`/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/`\n- **git 历史**（从老到新）：`5b638e2` SPA fallback → `6401221` fetch timeout → `c47e4c8` node cards → `976feb8` 5s TTL cache → `3d18856` 唐宋风骨 → `bf89d55` 合并冲突 → `a064922` React #31 修复 → `eb37d62` MVP contracts → `4beaf3f` Merge feat branch → `7ed601c` 风格统一\n- **环境差异**：听风机器 `ubuntu@VM-0-14-ubuntu`，我跑在 `node@7048705f208d`，两台机器都有 `.openclaw/workspace/outputs/`，互不干扰\n- **听的反馈情绪**：\"你就是个废物\"（在 token 反复 401 调试过程中），现在 push 已成功，需要避免类似低级错误（sed 改含特殊字符 token 失败没察觉）\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nUser asked to add MiniMax M3 model to their config, mentioning their MiniMax API now supports the M3 model (linked https://www.minimaxi.com/models/text/m3).\n\n## Early Progress\n- Assistant looked up `models` schema and `models.providers` config via gateway tool\n- Found `minimax-portal` provider has empty `models: []` array, uses OAuth, baseUrl is `https://api.minimaxi.com/anthropic/v1`\n- Confirmed MiniMax M3 was released June 1, 2026 via web_fetch of platform.minimax.io release notes\n- Confirmed M3 is available via Anthropic-compatible API endpoint\n- Tavily search unavailable (no API key); fell back to web_search/web_fetch\n- Existing M2.7 model uses ID `MiniMax-M2.7` (visible in nvidia provider entry)\n\n## Context for Suffix\nThe suffix needs to:\n- Determine the exact model ID string for M3 (likely `MiniMax-M3` following `MiniMax-M2.7` convention)\n- Add a new model entry to `models.providers[\"minimax-portal\"].models` array\n- Required fields based on schema: `id`, `name`, and likely `reasoning`, `input`, `contextWindow`, `maxTokens` (matching M2.7 structure)\n- Config file path: `/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json`\n- User has auth profile `minimax-portal:default` already configured with OAuth\n\n<read-files>\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-01.md\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-02.md\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-03.md\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-battle-frontend/src/app/globals.css\n</read-files>\n\n<modified-files>\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/src/App.jsx\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/src/components/ErrorBoundary.jsx\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/src/components/WalletBar.jsx\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/tailwind.config.js\n</modified-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"4cc47372","tokensBefore":98960,"details":{"readFiles":["/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-01.md","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-02.md","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-03.md","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-battle-frontend/src/app/globals.css"],"modifiedFiles":["/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/src/App.jsx","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/src/components/ErrorBoundary.jsx","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/src/components/WalletBar.jsx","/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/tailwind.config.js"]},"fromHook":false}
