{"type":"message","id":"48dc6299","parentId":"a00a5cf9","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:33:38.229Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1826 个 artifact 已删，磁盘从 1.1G 缩到 899M。active jsonl 从 1474 减到 1162。\n\n现在处理群聊 129k 这个高占用——群 session 自身 100 entries cap 刚生效，但它没被踢（保留是合理的，毕竟是当前活跃的群对话）。它的高 token 是它对话内容真的长，**只能用 `/compact` 触发压缩**，而 `/compact` 必须在群 session 视角内发送。\n\n让我试试 sessions_send 跨 session 发 slash："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kmqfkaj585s0_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /app/docs/concepts/multi-agent.md 2>/dev/null | grep -B 2 -A 10 \"sessions_send\\|session_key\" | head -40"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":140,"output":175,"cacheRead":50630,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50945,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780544011535,"responseId":"0670250c484f45d60a63f57796f6c926"}}
