{"type":"message","id":"c2a4740b","parentId":"7857551b","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:37:21.901Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zu5mauq08rkg_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw config --help 2>&1 | head -20 && echo \"---\" && openclaw gateway --help 2>&1 | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":53,"output":56,"cacheRead":53115,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53224,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780544235978,"responseId":"067025ecf61b9e7550df7d72e4df5c6f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"2f9b81ef","parentId":"c2a4740b","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:37:25.895Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_zu5mauq08rkg_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenClaw 2026.5.19 (unknown) — All your chats, one OpenClaw.\n\nUsage: openclaw config [options] [command]\n\nNon-interactive config helpers (get/set/patch/unset/file/schema/validate). Run\nwithout subcommand for guided setup.\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help           Display help for command\n  --section <section>  Configuration sections for guided setup (repeatable). Use\n                       with no subcommand. (default: [])\n\nCommands:\n  file                 Print the active config file path\n  get                  Get a config value by dot path\n  patch                Patch config from a JSON5 object in one validated write.\n                       Objects merge recursively, arrays/scalars replace, and\n                       null deletes a path.\n                       Examples:\n---\n\nOpenClaw 2026.5.19 (unknown) — All your chats, one OpenClaw.\n\nUsage: openclaw gateway [options] [command]\n\nRun, inspect, and query the WebSocket Gateway\n\nOptions:\n  --allow-unconfigured       Allow gateway start without enforcing\n                             gateway.mode=local in config (does not repair\n                             config) (default: false)\n  --auth <mode>              Gateway auth mode\n                             (\"none\"|\"token\"|\"password\"|\"trusted-proxy\")\n  --bind <mode>              Bind mode\n                             (\"loopback\"|\"lan\"|\"tailnet\"|\"auto\"|\"custom\").\n                             Defaults to config gateway.bind (or loopback).\n  --claude-cli-logs          Deprecated alias for --cli-backend-logs (default:\n                             false)\n  --cli-backend-logs         Only show CLI backend logs in the console (includes\n                             stdout/stderr) (default: false)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":3903,"aggregated":"OpenClaw 2026.5.19 (unknown) — All your chats, one OpenClaw.\n\nUsage: openclaw config [options] [command]\n\nNon-interactive config helpers (get/set/patch/unset/file/schema/validate). Run\nwithout subcommand for guided setup.\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help           Display help for command\n  --section <section>  Configuration sections for guided setup (repeatable). Use\n                       with no subcommand. (default: [])\n\nCommands:\n  file                 Print the active config file path\n  get                  Get a config value by dot path\n  patch                Patch config from a JSON5 object in one validated write.\n                       Objects merge recursively, arrays/scalars replace, and\n                       null deletes a path.\n                       Examples:\n---\n\nOpenClaw 2026.5.19 (unknown) — All your chats, one OpenClaw.\n\nUsage: openclaw gateway [options] [command]\n\nRun, inspect, and query the WebSocket Gateway\n\nOptions:\n  --allow-unconfigured       Allow gateway start without enforcing\n                             gateway.mode=local in config (does not repair\n                             config) (default: false)\n  --auth <mode>              Gateway auth mode\n                             (\"none\"|\"token\"|\"password\"|\"trusted-proxy\")\n  --bind <mode>              Bind mode\n                             (\"loopback\"|\"lan\"|\"tailnet\"|\"auto\"|\"custom\").\n                             Defaults to config gateway.bind (or loopback).\n  --claude-cli-logs          Deprecated alias for --cli-backend-logs (default:\n                             false)\n  --cli-backend-logs         Only show CLI backend logs in the console (includes\n                             stdout/stderr) (default: false)","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780544245890}}
