{"type":"message","id":"4eb3058e","parentId":"f36673cb","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:37:32.256Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_byrdnex1wcdq_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenClaw 2026.5.19 (unknown) — All your chats, one OpenClaw.\n\nUsage: openclaw config patch [options]\n\nPatch config from a JSON5 object in one validated write.\nObjects merge recursively, arrays/scalars replace, and null deletes a path.\nExamples:\nopenclaw config patch --file ./openclaw.patch.json5 --dry-run\nopenclaw config patch --stdin\n\nOptions:\n  --allow-exec           Dry-run only: allow exec SecretRef resolvability checks\n                         (may execute provider commands) (default: false)\n  --dry-run              Validate changes without writing openclaw.json (checks\n                         schema and SecretRef resolvability; exec SecretRefs are\n                         skipped unless --allow-exec is set) (default: false)\n  --file <path>          Read a JSON5 config patch object from file\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output dry-run result as JSON (default: false)\n  --replace-path <path>  Replace the object or array at this dot/bracket path\n                         instead of recursively applying it (repeatable)\n                         (default: [])\n  --stdin                Read a JSON5 config patch object from stdin (default:\n                         false)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2065,"aggregated":"OpenClaw 2026.5.19 (unknown) — All your chats, one OpenClaw.\n\nUsage: openclaw config patch [options]\n\nPatch config from a JSON5 object in one validated write.\nObjects merge recursively, arrays/scalars replace, and null deletes a path.\nExamples:\nopenclaw config patch --file ./openclaw.patch.json5 --dry-run\nopenclaw config patch --stdin\n\nOptions:\n  --allow-exec           Dry-run only: allow exec SecretRef resolvability checks\n                         (may execute provider commands) (default: false)\n  --dry-run              Validate changes without writing openclaw.json (checks\n                         schema and SecretRef resolvability; exec SecretRefs are\n                         skipped unless --allow-exec is set) (default: false)\n  --file <path>          Read a JSON5 config patch object from file\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output dry-run result as JSON (default: false)\n  --replace-path <path>  Replace the object or array at this dot/bracket path\n                         instead of recursively applying it (repeatable)\n                         (default: [])\n  --stdin                Read a JSON5 config patch object from stdin (default:\n                         false)","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780544252089}}
