{"type":"message","id":"dcaec306","parentId":"74c3378f","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:37:58.072Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_hbv9ht8ye178_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/app/docs/cli/sessions.md:108:- Cleanup also prunes unreferenced primary transcripts, compaction checkpoints, and trajectory sidecars older than `session.maintenance.pruneAfter`; files still referenced by `sessions.json` are preserved.\n/app/docs/concepts/session.md:121:      pruneAfter: \"30d\",\n/app/docs/gateway/configuration-examples.md:171:      pruneAfter: \"30d\",\n/app/docs/gateway/config-agents.md:1265:      pruneAfter: \"30d\",\n/app/docs/gateway/config-agents.md:1304:  - `pruneAfter`: age cutoff for stale entries (default `30d`).\n/app/docs/gateway/config-agents.md:1307:  - `resetArchiveRetention`: retention for `*.reset.<timestamp>` transcript archives. Defaults to `pruneAfter`; set `false` to disable.\n/app/docs/reference/session-management-compaction.md:82:- `pruneAfter`: stale-entry age cutoff (default `30d`)\n/app/docs/reference/session-management-compaction.md:84:- `resetArchiveRetention`: retention for `*.reset.<timestamp>` transcript archives (default: same as `pruneAfter`; `false` disables cleanup)\n---\n/app/node_modules/zod-to-json-schema/.prettierrc.json\n/app/node_modules/zod-to-json-schema/package.json\n/app/node_modules/zod-to-json-schema/dist/esm/package.json\n/app/node_modules/zod-to-json-schema/dist/cjs/package.json\n/app/node_modules/mdn-data/api/inheritance.schema.json\n---\nOpenClaw config is invalid\nFile: ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\nProblem:\n  - agents.defaults.compaction: Invalid input\n\nFix: openclaw doctor --fix\nInspect: openclaw config validate\nStatus, health, logs, and doctor commands still run with invalid config."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":8740,"aggregated":"/app/docs/cli/sessions.md:108:- Cleanup also prunes unreferenced primary transcripts, compaction checkpoints, and trajectory sidecars older than `session.maintenance.pruneAfter`; files still referenced by `sessions.json` are preserved.\n/app/docs/concepts/session.md:121:      pruneAfter: \"30d\",\n/app/docs/gateway/configuration-examples.md:171:      pruneAfter: \"30d\",\n/app/docs/gateway/config-agents.md:1265:      pruneAfter: \"30d\",\n/app/docs/gateway/config-agents.md:1304:  - `pruneAfter`: age cutoff for stale entries (default `30d`).\n/app/docs/gateway/config-agents.md:1307:  - `resetArchiveRetention`: retention for `*.reset.<timestamp>` transcript archives. Defaults to `pruneAfter`; set `false` to disable.\n/app/docs/reference/session-management-compaction.md:82:- `pruneAfter`: stale-entry age cutoff (default `30d`)\n/app/docs/reference/session-management-compaction.md:84:- `resetArchiveRetention`: retention for `*.reset.<timestamp>` transcript archives (default: same as `pruneAfter`; `false` disables cleanup)\n---\n/app/node_modules/zod-to-json-schema/.prettierrc.json\n/app/node_modules/zod-to-json-schema/package.json\n/app/node_modules/zod-to-json-schema/dist/esm/package.json\n/app/node_modules/zod-to-json-schema/dist/cjs/package.json\n/app/node_modules/mdn-data/api/inheritance.schema.json\n---\nOpenClaw config is invalid\nFile: ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\nProblem:\n  - agents.defaults.compaction: Invalid input\n\nFix: openclaw doctor --fix\nInspect: openclaw config validate\nStatus, health, logs, and doctor commands still run with invalid config.","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780544278068}}
{"type":"message","id":"b4f65665","parentId":"dcaec306","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:38:02.637Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"pruneAfter 实际是在 **`session.maintenance`** 下，不是 `agents.defaults.compaction`！session.md:121 才是正确位置："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vagjbqi0xa81_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /app/docs/concepts/session.md 2>/dev/null | sed -n '100,150p' && echo \"---\" && grep -B 1 -A 8 \"session.*maintenance\" /app/docs/gateway/config-agents.md 2>/dev/null | head -40"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":412,"output":117,"cacheRead":54213,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54742,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780544278074,"responseId":"067026168643794dcd5d6377e6ec9113"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b4384b65","parentId":"b4f65665","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:38:02.788Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_vagjbqi0xa81_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- `sessionStartedAt`: when the current `sessionId` began; daily reset uses this.\n- `lastInteractionAt`: last user/channel interaction that extends idle lifetime.\n- `updatedAt`: last store-row mutation; useful for listing and pruning, but not\n  authoritative for daily/idle reset freshness.\n\nOlder rows without `sessionStartedAt` are resolved from the transcript JSONL\nsession header when available. If an older row also lacks `lastInteractionAt`,\nidle freshness falls back to that session start time, not to later bookkeeping\nwrites.\n\n## Session maintenance\n\nOpenClaw automatically bounds session storage over time. By default, it runs\nin `warn` mode (reports what would be cleaned). Set `session.maintenance.mode`\nto `\"enforce\"` for automatic cleanup:\n\n```json5\n{\n  session: {\n    maintenance: {\n      mode: \"enforce\",\n      pruneAfter: \"30d\",\n      maxEntries: 500,\n    },\n  },\n}\n```\n\nFor production-sized `maxEntries` limits, Gateway runtime writes use a small high-water buffer and clean back down to the configured cap in batches. Session store reads do not prune or cap entries during Gateway startup. This avoids running full store cleanup on every startup or isolated cron session. `openclaw sessions cleanup --enforce` applies the cap immediately.\n\nMaintenance preserves durable external conversation pointers, including group\nsessions and thread-scoped chat sessions, while still allowing synthetic cron,\nhook, heartbeat, ACP, and sub-agent entries to age out.\n\nIf you previously used direct-message isolation and later returned\n`session.dmScope` to `main`, preview stale peer-keyed DM rows with\n`openclaw sessions cleanup --dry-run --fix-dm-scope`. Applying the same flag\nretires those old direct-DM rows and keeps their transcripts as deleted\narchives.\n\nPreview with `openclaw sessions cleanup --dry-run`.\n\n## Inspecting sessions\n\n- `openclaw status` -- session store path and recent activity.\n- `openclaw sessions --json` -- all sessions (filter with `--active <minutes>`).\n- `/status` in chat -- context usage, model, and toggles.\n- `/context list` -- what is in the system prompt.\n\n## Further reading\n\n---"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":46,"aggregated":"- `sessionStartedAt`: when the current `sessionId` began; daily reset uses this.\n- `lastInteractionAt`: last user/channel interaction that extends idle lifetime.\n- `updatedAt`: last store-row mutation; useful for listing and pruning, but not\n  authoritative for daily/idle reset freshness.\n\nOlder rows without `sessionStartedAt` are resolved from the transcript JSONL\nsession header when available. If an older row also lacks `lastInteractionAt`,\nidle freshness falls back to that session start time, not to later bookkeeping\nwrites.\n\n## Session maintenance\n\nOpenClaw automatically bounds session storage over time. By default, it runs\nin `warn` mode (reports what would be cleaned). Set `session.maintenance.mode`\nto `\"enforce\"` for automatic cleanup:\n\n```json5\n{\n  session: {\n    maintenance: {\n      mode: \"enforce\",\n      pruneAfter: \"30d\",\n      maxEntries: 500,\n    },\n  },\n}\n```\n\nFor production-sized `maxEntries` limits, Gateway runtime writes use a small high-water buffer and clean back down to the configured cap in batches. Session store reads do not prune or cap entries during Gateway startup. This avoids running full store cleanup on every startup or isolated cron session. `openclaw sessions cleanup --enforce` applies the cap immediately.\n\nMaintenance preserves durable external conversation pointers, including group\nsessions and thread-scoped chat sessions, while still allowing synthetic cron,\nhook, heartbeat, ACP, and sub-agent entries to age out.\n\nIf you previously used direct-message isolation and later returned\n`session.dmScope` to `main`, preview stale peer-keyed DM rows with\n`openclaw sessions cleanup --dry-run --fix-dm-scope`. Applying the same flag\nretires those old direct-DM rows and keeps their transcripts as deleted\narchives.\n\nPreview with `openclaw sessions cleanup --dry-run`.\n\n## Inspecting sessions\n\n- `openclaw status` -- session store path and recent activity.\n- `openclaw sessions --json` -- all sessions (filter with `--active <minutes>`).\n- `/status` in chat -- context usage, model, and toggles.\n- `/context list` -- what is in the system prompt.\n\n## Further reading\n\n---","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780544282775}}
{"type":"message","id":"6f9aeefb","parentId":"b4384b65","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:38:08.897Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"位置对，**`session.maintenance`**，不是 `agents.defaults.compaction`。修一下："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_csrbwd3aarxa_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json","edits":[{"oldText":"  \"agents\": {\n    \"defaults\": {\n      \"compaction\": {\n        \"mode\": \"default\",\n        \"reserveTokensFloor\": 30000,\n        \"pruneAfter\": \"10d\",\n        \"maxEntries\": 100,\n        \"maxDiskBytes\": 1073741824,\n        \"highWaterBytes\": 858993459\n      }\n    }\n  },","newText":"  \"agents\": {\n    \"defaults\": {\n      \"compaction\": {\n        \"mode\": \"default\",\n        \"reserveTokensFloor\": 30000\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"session\": {\n    \"maintenance\": {\n      \"mode\": \"enforce\",\n      \"pruneAfter\": \"10d\",\n      \"maxEntries\": 100,\n      \"maxDiskBytes\": 1073741824,\n      \"highWaterBytes\": 858993459\n    }\n  },"}]}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":490,"output":274,"cacheRead":54728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55492,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780544282790,"responseId":"0670261b2e65db832f6cfd40c8c33512"}}
